---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import {
	APP_NAME,
	CONTACT_EMAIL,
	LEGAL_UPDATED,
	OPERATOR,
} from "../site.config";
---

<Layout title={`Terms of use — ${APP_NAME}`} description={`The terms for using ${APP_NAME}.`}>
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 pt-10 sm:px-6">
		<p class="label">Last updated {LEGAL_UPDATED}</p>
		<h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Terms of use</h1>
		<article class="prose-legal mt-6">
			<p>
				These terms are an agreement between you and {OPERATOR} for using the {APP_NAME} app and this website. By
				creating an account or using the app you accept them.
			</p>

			<h2>Train at your own risk</h2>
			<p>
				{APP_NAME} helps you record workouts. It does not give medical advice, and the numbers it shows — estimated
				one-rep maxes, warm-up weights, plate loads — are estimates. Talk to a doctor before starting a new training
				program, use a spotter for heavy lifts, and stop if something hurts.
			</p>

			<h2>Your account</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>You sign in with Google or Apple and are responsible for keeping that account secure.</li>
				<li>You must be at least 13 years old.</li>
				<li>You can delete your account at any time from Settings → Delete account.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Your data</h2>
			<p>
				Your workout data is stored on your phone and belongs to you. Because it isn't backed up on our servers,
				uninstalling the app or losing your phone deletes it unless you exported a backup. See the{" "}
				<a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for details.
			</p>

			<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
			<p>Don't misuse the service: no attempts to break, overload or reverse engineer our sign-in servers.</p>

			<h2>The app is provided as is</h2>
			<p>
				We work to keep {APP_NAME} reliable, but we provide it "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the extent
				the law allows, we aren't liable for injuries, lost data or indirect damages arising from using the app.
			</p>

			<h2>Changes and termination</h2>
			<p>
				We may update these terms or the app. If a change matters, we'll tell you in the app before it applies. We
				may suspend accounts that break these terms.
			</p>

			<h2>Governing law</h2>
			<p>These terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></p>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
